sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Frontend
    participant API as Core API
    participant DB as Relational Database
    participant Storage as Blob Storage
    participant Queue as Message Queue
    participant Worker as PDF Parser Worker
    participant CLI as PDF Parser

    User->>Frontend: Select and upload timetable PDF
    Frontend->>API: POST /pdf-parser/jobs/upload
    API->>API: Validate PDF and compute fingerprint
    API->>DB: Create queued parseJob
    API->>Storage: Store PDF
    API->>Queue: Enqueue pdf.parse job
    API-->>Frontend: 202 Accepted with jobId

    Queue-->>Worker: Deliver parse job
    Worker->>Storage: Download PDF
    Worker->>CLI: Parse PDF with registered adapter
    CLI-->>Worker: Normalized parser result
    Worker->>API: POST /pdf-parser/jobs/:jobId/callback
    API->>DB: Persist timetable data and completed status
    API-->>Worker: 202 Accepted

    loop Until parse job completes
        Frontend->>API: GET /pdf-parser/jobs/:jobId
        API->>DB: Read parseJob status
        DB-->>API: Completed status
        API-->>Frontend: Job status and result metadata
    end
    Frontend->>API: GET /pdf-parser/jobs/:jobId/result
    API->>DB: Read parser result
    DB-->>API: Normalized parser result
    API-->>Frontend: 200 OK
    Frontend-->>User: Display imported timetable data
